        rdfs:label "Azpeitia et al. (2021) & Prusinkiewicz et al. (2007) TFL1-LFY-AP1/CAL-SOC1 floral GRN perturbation and accelerating plastochron Romanesco fractal inflorescence morphogenesis — Code-to-model traceability: 58/100" ;
